ent":{"encoding":"utf-8","text":"* LDO-QUIET-SKY130 DUT v7 (divider trimmed to center systematic offset)\n* PMOS pass + NMOS-input 5T OTA (resistive tail), output-pole dominant loop\n.subckt DUT VIN VOUT VSS VREF\n\n* Feedback divider: k = R2/(R1+R2) ~ 0.5021 (centers OTA systematic offset)\nR1 VOUT FB 23.8k\nR2 FB VSS 24k\n\n* Error amplifier: large NMOS pair (low flicker / high gm)\nXM1 ND1 FB NT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=100 L=1.9 nf=1 m=2\nXM2 ND2 VREF NT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=100 L=1.9 nf=1 m=2\nRT NT VSS 1.5k\nXM3 ND1 ND1 VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=50 L=1.9 nf=1\nXM4 ND2 ND1 VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=50 L=1.9 nf=1\n\n* Pass device\nXMP VOUT ND2 VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=100 L=0.16 nf=1 m=5\n\n* Compensation: RC shelf at gate + VIN feedforward for 1MHz PSRR\nRSH ND2 NCM 250k\nCSH NCM VSS 2.5p\nCFF VIN ND2 2p\n\n.ends DUT\n"},"hash":"sha256:9e8a61ce856a9b0adb95d62a5e6ff80d31a711e8ca783a4327fc23e2a2b51089","id":"source-c64c2f6b688cd548","path":"submitted.spice"}],"sourcePolicy":"copy"},"symbolLibrary":{"hash":"razavi-reference-v1","id":"razavi-symbols","version":"1"},"structureRevision":0}
